    {
      "name": "af_relax_chosen",
      "comment": "CHOSEN recourse. You narrowed your own attention, so an outstanding residual is a reason to widen it -- and you may, unilaterally. Dropping the frame re-arms `af_effective_aperture`, which re-arms the decode. Attention as a graph move rather than a parameter.",
